<title>USA: Shopko Phar-Mor terminate merger agreement.</title>
<headline>Shopko Phar-Mor terminate merger agreement.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer ShopKo Stores Inc. and retail drug chain Phar-Mor Inc., said Wednesday they called off their planned $1 billion merger.</p>
<p>The companies, which announced the proposed merger in September, said in a news release they cancelled the proposed deal because of &quot;continuing uncertainties&quot; that they did not specify.</p>
</text>
